{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:35:48Z","content":"# 🎓 Student Survival App 🧑‍🎓🔥\n> **Tagline:** *“Survive college. One deadline at a time. 😂”*  \n> **Subtitle:** *“Because college is already hard enough 😭”*  \n> **Made by students, for students ❤️**  \n> *“Now go study... or at least pretend to. 😂”*\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Recommended Active Workspace\nThe complete application has been built in your project directory:\n👉 **`C:\\Users\\DELL\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\student-survival-app`**  \n*(I recommend setting this directory as your active workspace in Antigravity).*\n\nIt has also been synchronized to your Desktop directory for immediate access:  \n📁 **`C:\\Users\\DELL\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\student survival\\student-survival-app`**\n\nTo launch the app immediately, simply open **[`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/DELL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/student-survival-app/index.html)** in any web browser (**Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Brave, Safari, Firefox**). Zero build steps or npm installations are required!\n\n---\n\n## 🖼️ Visual Identity: “Life of a Student” Artwork\n\nThe uploaded **“Life of a Student”** notebook illustration (depicting the teacher sitting on Mid, Quiz, Project, Assignments, and the crushed student) is the core visual theme:\n\n1. **App Icon & Logo**:\n   - Clean rounded-square crop with glowing borders and glass badge on the splash screen, login page, top header, profile, and browser favicon.\n2. **Full-Screen Background**:\n   - Set with `background-size: cover; background-position: center; background-attachment: fixed;` so the artwork never stretches or distorts.\n   - Intelligently positioned on mobile screens so the notebook title and cartoon remain visible.\n   - Paired with a dark translucent glassmorphism overlay (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)`) ensuring text readability.\n\n---\n\n## ✨ Features & Architecture Overview\n\n### 1. ⏳ Animated Loading / Splash Screen\n- **Duration**: ~2.5 seconds with live progress bar (`0%` to `100%`) and status messages.\n- **Dynamic Quotes**: Smoothly cycles through funny student thoughts:\n  - *“📚 Finding your motivation... ERROR 404.”*\n  - *“☕ Brewing academic survival mode...”*\n  - *“😭 Checking how many assignments you forgot...”*\n  - *“🧠 Waking up your last remaining brain cell...”*\n  - *“📅 Calculating how badly you're behind...”*\n  - *“🚨 Detecting upcoming deadlines...”*\n  - *“😴 Checking whether you should sleep or study...”*\n  - *“📚 Loading syllabus... Please don't panic.”*\n  - *“☕ Connecting to caffeine server...”*\n  - *“🎓 Preparing your survival mode...”*\n- Includes a **“Skip to App &rarr;”** button.\n\n### 2. 🔐 Login & Welcome Page\n- Glassmorphic login card with student logo and college tagline.\n- Fields: **👤 Student Name**, **📧 Email**, **🔒 Password** (optional, zero stress), and **☑ Remember me**.\n- Quick actions: **🚀 Enter Survival Mode** and **🎒 Continue as Guest** (instant 1-click access).\n- Post-login greeting: *“Welcome back, [Student Name]! 👋 Ready to survive another day? 🔥”* and *“Your assignments missed you. 😭”*.\n\n### 3. 🏠 Home Survival Dashboard\n- **Personalized Greeting**: *“Hey [Student Name]! 👋 Ready to survive today?”*\n- **🎓 Academic Survival Score (0–100)**: Real-time weighted algorithm factoring in attendance health (45%), assignment backlog (35%), and exam proximity (20%) with an animated SVG radial gauge.\n- **🔥 Daily Student Wisdom**: Shuffleable collegiate quotes (*“Attendance is temporary. Backlogs are forever.”*).\n- **Summary Cards**: Clickable overview tiles for **Attendance**, **Assignments**, **Canteen**, **Today's Timetable**, and **Next Exam Countdown**.\n- **😂 Large Feature Button**: **“SHOULD I SLEEP OR STUDY?”** generating instant randomized collegiate advice.\n\n### 4. 📊 Attendance Calculator & Bunk Engine\n- Real-time mathematical engine:\n  $$\\text{Attendance } \\% = \\left(\\frac{\\text{Attended Classes}}{\\text{Total Classes}}\\right) \\times 100$$\n- Visual color-coded progress bars with a **75% university minimum threshold line**:\n  - 🟢 **Safe** ($\\ge 75\\%$)\n  - 🟡 **Warning** ($65\\% - 74\\%$)\n  - 🔴 **Danger** ($< 65\\%$)\n- **Exact Bunk & Rescue Math**:\n  - **Safe Bunk Allowance**: Calculates how many classes you can skip without dropping below 75%:\n    $$\\text{Safe Bunks} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\text{Attended} - 0.75 \\times \\text{Total}}{0.75} \\right\\rfloor$$\n  - **Shortage Recovery**: Calculates consecutive classes you must attend to escape detention:\n    $$\\text{Classes Needed} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{0.75 \\times \\text{Total} - \\text{Attended}}{0.25} \\right\\rceil$$\n- **1-Click Quick Logging**: `+1 Present 🟢` and `+1 Absent 🔴` buttons for fast post-lecture tracking.\n- **Standalone Bunk Simulator**: Test hypothetical bunking scenarios.\n- Pre-populated with core courses: **DBMS**, **Data Structures (DS)**, **Digital System Design (DSD)**, **Value Added Course (VAC)**, **OOP / Java**, and **COA**.\n\n### 5. 📝 Assignment Countdown\n- Tracks upcoming deliverables sorted automatically by nearest deadline.\n- Dynamic urgency tags:\n  - 🔥 **Due today** (<24 hours)\n  - ⚠️ **2 days left**\n  - 🟢 **7 days left**\n  - 💀 **Overdue**\n  - ✅ **Completed**\n- Filter pills: **All**, **🔥 Due Today / Soon**, **⏳ Pending**, and **✅ Completed**.\n- Sound-synthesized celebratory chime upon completing an assignment.\n\n### 6. 🍔 Canteen Status Hub\n- Live status: **🟢 OPEN** / **🔴 CLOSED** (Operating Hours: 08:00 AM – 06:00 PM).\n- Dynamic messages:\n  - OPEN: *“🍔 Your wallet is in danger.”*\n  - CLOSED: *“😭 RIP. Survive until tomorrow.”*\n- Interactive toggle button to switch between OPEN and CLOSED during demos.\n- Student menu with prices:\n  - 🍜 Maggi — ₹40\n  - 🥪 Sandwich — ₹50\n  - 🍕 Pizza — ₹80\n  - ☕ Cold Coffee — ₹50\n  - 🥤 Cold Drink — ₹30\n  - 🍟 French Fries — ₹60\n  - 🥟 Samosa (2 pcs) — ₹25\n  - 🧃 Cutting Chai — ₹15\n  - 🥐 Veg Patties — ₹25\n- **Canteen Bill & Bunk Calculator**: Select snacks to compute total pocket money damage.\n\n### 7. 📅 Weekly Timetable\n- Monday through Saturday schedule with room numbers, faculty names, and break times.\n- Automatically detects and highlights the current day of the week.\n- Full CRUD: Add Class, Edit Class, Delete Class.\n\n### 8. ⏳ Exam Countdown Tickers\n- Live countdown ticking every single second: **DAYS : HOURS : MINUTES : SECONDS**.\n- Urgency badges: 🚨 **PANIC MODE (<3 Days)** vs ⏳ **Approaching**.\n- Displays venue halls and syllabus priority topics.\n\n### 9. 😂 Should I Sleep or Study? (Collegiate Neural Engine)\n- Interactive diagnostic wizard:\n  - 😴 Hours of sleep last night (0–12h slider)\n  - 📚 Syllabus pending (0%–100% slider)\n  - 🧠 Brain status: **Zombie 🧟**, **Drowsy 🥱**, **OK 🙂**, **Caffeinated ⚡**\n- Smart verdicts based on physical exhaustion vs exam proximity:\n  - *“📚 STUDY! Your exam is coming.”*\n  - *“😴 SLEEP! A tired brain learns nothing.”*\n  - *“📝 Finish the assignment first. Then sleep peacefully.”*\n  - *“☕ Coffee + Study + Regret = College Life.”*\n  - *“😭 You opened the app instead of studying. Nice.”*\n- **Built-in 20-Minute Power Nap Timer** with start/pause/reset and an audio wake-up alarm chime.\n\n### 10. 📱 Mobile-First Experience\n- Sleek bottom navigation bar: **🏠 Home**, **📊 Attend**, **📝 Tasks** (with red notification badge), **📅 Schedule**, **⏳ Exams**.\n- Touch targets $\\ge 44\\text{px}$.\n- Intelligently cropped background illustration that remains crisp and visible.\n\n### 11. 💾 LocalStorage & Profile Management\n- Browser `localStorage` maintains student credentials, attendance, assignments, timetable, and exams across browser refreshes.\n- Profile modal to edit name, email, and branch, or reset to sample data anytime.\n- Logout confirmation modal:\n  - *“Are you sure you want to escape Survival Mode? 😂”*\n  - **Stay 😭** | **Logout 🚪**\n\n### 12. 🔊 Web Audio API Sound Synthesizer\n- Built-in zero-dependency sound synthesis for UI taps, celebratory victory chimes, alerts, and alarm bells. Mute/unmute toggle available in the header.\n\n---\n\n## 📂 Project Structure\n\n```\nstudent-survival-app/\n│\n├── index.html                   # Entry point (Tailwind CDN, semantic HTML5, modals)\n├── styles.css                   # Glassmorphism, animations, cover background positioning\n├── app.js                       # State machine, math engine, real-time tickers, audio synthesizer\n├── README.md                    # Documentation & college presentation walkthrough\n│\n└── assets/\n    ├── life-of-a-student.jpg    # Uploaded notebook illustration\n    ├── logo.jpg                 # App logo\n    └── student-life-logo.svg    # Vector artwork\n```\n\nAll files are ready to view, test, and demonstrate!","thinking":"The instruction specifies that a new project requires creating a subdirectory within the default project location, since the user has no active workspace. Therefore, project creation involves establishing this subdirectory. Furthermore, the user should be advised to set this newly created subdirectory as the active workspace.\n\n\n"}
